Name: rust-url
Short Name: rust-url
URL: https://github.com/servo/rust-url
Version: 0.3.2
Revision: bcf5a2a98986dd5dfb252d3e977d2da380b09fda
Update Mechanism: Manual (tools/import.py rust-url, history replayed linearly)
License: MIT OR Apache-2.0
License File: LICENSE-APACHE, LICENSE-MIT
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
Processing of data: URL according to WHATWG’s Fetch Standard

Local Modifications:
The crates (6) live in third_party/rust-url/<crate>, one directory per package; their manifests are rewritten by
tools/flatten.py (path dependencies, inlined workspace inheritance, one version per crate) and patched by
tools/fixups.sh and tools/patches/. Everything else of the upstream is in third_party/rust-url/ unchanged.

Crates:
  data-url 0.3.2 third_party/rust-url/data-url
  form_urlencoded 1.2.2 third_party/rust-url/form_urlencoded
  idna 1.1.0 third_party/rust-url/idna
  percent-encoding 2.3.2 third_party/rust-url/percent-encoding
  url 2.5.8 third_party/rust-url/rust-url-url
  url_debug_tests 0.0.0 third_party/rust-url/url_debug_tests
